        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Franchises: Wars series, Fire Emblem\n- Companies: Intelligent Systems, Nintendo\n- Products: Famicom Wars, Advance Wars, Nintendo Wars, Family Computer (Famicom)\n- Genres: military turn-based tactics video games, tactical role-playing video games\n\nFacts:\n- The Wars series is also known as Famicom Wars in Japan, Advance Wars in the West, and sometimes Nintendo Wars as a whole.\n- The Wars series is a military turn-based tactics video game franchise usually developed by Intelligent Systems and published by Nintendo.\n- Fire Emblem was first produced and published for the Family Computer (Famicom).\n- Fire Emblem is a tactical role-playing video game franchise developed by Intelligent Systems and published by Nintendo.\n- The Fire Emblem series consists of twelve original games, three remakes, and two spin-offs that are playable across multiple game systems.",
